{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41935","headline":"对雨寄朐山林番明府 · 李中","name":"对雨寄朐山林番明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竟日如丝不暂停，莎堦闲听滴秋声。\n斜飘虚阁琴书润，冷逼幽窗梦寐清。\n开户只添搜句味，看山还阻上楼情。\n遥知公退琴堂静，坐对萧骚饮兴生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}